---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';

const bookUrl = 'https://calendar.notion.so/meet/cameronearloliver/qc3y04oud';

const record = [
  { before: '$12M', after: '$20M', label: 'General construction' },
  { before: '120 days', after: '45 days', label: 'Software onboarding' },
  { before: '40%', after: '85%', label: 'Capacity utilization' },
  { before: '15', after: '100', label: 'Scaled through a Series A' },
];

const scorecard = [
  { name: 'Revenue vs. plan', weeks: ['r','y','y','g','g','g'], now: '103%' },
  { name: 'Cash collected', weeks: ['y','y','g','g','y','y'], now: '88%' },
  { name: 'Gross margin', weeks: ['y','g','g','g','g','g'], now: '42%' },
  { name: 'Closed-won rate', weeks: ['r','r','y','y','g','g'], now: '31%' },
];
const cell = { g: '#5C7A3B', y: '#C08A2D', r: '#B0402F' };

const steps = [
  { n: '01', title: 'We map your buyer', body: 'How you acquire customers, what you do to serve them, and how you keep them coming back. We walk the whole path.' },
  { n: '02', title: 'We see what it takes to deliver', body: 'What each part needs to run, and what good actually looks like in the numbers, not a guess.' },
  { n: '03', title: 'We focus your time where it counts', body: 'Grow revenue, deliver it faster, or take the stress off, with the right people and process in place.' },
];
---

<Layout
  title="Growth Map | You're fixing the wrong thing"
  description="When growth stalls, it's almost never where you think. I'm an operator who gets in the trenches with owner-led businesses and fixes what's actually holding them back. Book a free call."
  canonicalPath="/"
>
  <!-- 1 · HERO -->
  <section class="relative overflow-hidden border-b border-hairline px-6 py-16 md:py-24">
    <svg class="pointer-events-none absolute -right-36 -top-16 h-[620px] w-[620px] text-moss opacity-35" viewBox="0 0 600 600" aria-hidden="true">
      <g fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.2" opacity="0.75">
        <path d="M300,80 C420,70 520,160 530,280 C540,400 460,520 330,530 C200,540 80,460 75,320 C70,180 180,90 300,80 Z" />
        <path d="M300,150 C388,142 462,196 470,286 C478,376 416,462 320,470 C224,478 140,420 136,312 C132,204 216,158 300,150 Z" />
        <path d="M300,215 C352,210 398,248 403,300 C408,352 372,404 316,409 C260,414 210,378 207,318 C204,258 248,220 300,215 Z" />
        <circle cx="300" cy="301" r="6" fill="currentColor" stroke="none" />
      </g>
    </svg>
    <div class="relative z-10 mx-auto grid max-w-[1200px] items-center gap-10 md:grid-cols-[1.15fr_0.85fr] md:gap-14">
      <div>
        <h1 class="font-display text-5xl leading-[1.04] text-ink sm:text-6xl md:text-[64px]">
          You're fixing the <em>wrong thing.</em>
        </h1>
        <p class="mt-6 max-w-[50ch] text-lg leading-relaxed text-fern">
          When growth stalls, everything feels chaotic and you're not sure of your next move. I get in the trenches with you, and we fix what's actually holding you back.
        </p>
        <div class="mt-8">
          <a href={bookUrl} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="inline-block rounded-full border border-ink bg-ink px-8 py-4 text-[15px] font-semibold text-parchment transition-opacity hover:opacity-90">
            Book a call
          </a>
          <p class="mt-3.5 max-w-[46ch] text-sm text-fern">A free 30-minute call, no pitch. I'll tell you what I'd fix, and you can run with it, with me or on your own.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="flex justify-center md:justify-end">
        <figure class="max-w-[340px]">
          <img src="/images/headshot.jpeg" alt="Cameron Oliver" class="w-full rounded-[16px] border border-hairline shadow-sm" loading="eager" />
        </figure>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- 2 · TRACK RECORD BAND -->
  <section class="relative overflow-hidden border-b border-hairline bg-ink px-6 py-10">
    <div class="relative z-10 mx-auto max-w-[1200px]">
      <p class="mb-6 font-mono text-[10.5px] font-medium uppercase tracking-[0.16em] text-cream/55">What I've done</p>
      <div class="grid grid-cols-2 gap-x-8 gap-y-7 md:grid-cols-4">
        {record.map((r) => (
          <div>
            <p class="font-display text-xl leading-none text-cream md:text-[26px]">
              {r.before} <span class="text-moss">&rarr;</span> {r.after}
            </p>
            <p class="mt-2 font-mono text-[10px] uppercase tracking-[0.14em] text-cream/55">{r.label}</p>
          </div>
        ))}
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- 3 · THE TWO THINGS -->
  <section class="border-b border-hairline px-6 py-16 md:py-24">
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-[1000px]">
      <h2 class="font-display text-3xl leading-tight text-ink md:text-[40px]">
        No matter your industry, product, or service, every business does <em>two things.</em>
      </h2>
      <div class="mt-10 grid items-stretch gap-5 md:grid-cols-[1fr_auto_1fr]">
        <div class="rounded-[16px] border border-hairline bg-white/60 p-8">
          <p class="font-display text-5xl leading-none text-moss">1</p>
          <h3 class="font-display mt-4 text-2xl text-ink">Acquire customers</h3>
          <p class="mt-2 leading-relaxed text-fern">You have to get people to buy.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="flex items-center justify-center">
          <span class="font-mono text-sm text-fern">then</span>
        </div>
        <div class="rounded-[16px] border border-hairline bg-white/60 p-8">
          <p class="font-display text-5xl leading-none text-moss">2</p>
          <h3 class="font-display mt-4 text-2xl text-ink">Serve those customers</h3>
          <p class="mt-2 leading-relaxed text-fern">You have to deliver, and keep them coming back.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <p class="mt-9 max-w-[70ch] text-lg leading-relaxed text-fern">
        When you're tired, frustrated, and not sure why you're getting the results you are, the answer is always back in those two things. That's where I start.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- 4 · HOW IT WORKS -->
  <section class="border-b border-hairline bg-parchment-deep px-6 py-16 md:py-20">
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-[1100px]">
      <p class="doc-label text-ink">Where I start</p>
      <div class="mt-9 grid gap-10 md:grid-cols-[1fr_0.9fr] md:items-center md:gap-14">
        <div class="space-y-7">
          {steps.map((s) => (
            <div class="flex gap-5">
              <p class="font-mono text-xl font-medium text-moss">{s.n}</p>
              <div>
                <h3 class="font-display text-[22px] leading-tight text-ink">{s.title}</h3>
                <p class="mt-1.5 text-[15px] leading-relaxed text-fern">{s.body}</p>
              </div>
            </div>
          ))}
        </div>
        <div class="rounded-[14px] border border-hairline bg-white/70 p-6">
          <p class="mb-4 font-mono text-[10.5px] font-medium uppercase tracking-[0.14em] text-fern">What good looks like</p>
          {scorecard.map((m) => (
            <div class="flex items-center justify-between gap-3 border-t border-dashed border-hairline py-2.5 first:border-t-0">
              <span class="text-[13.5px] font-medium text-ink">{m.name}</span>
              <span class="flex items-center gap-1.5">
                {m.weeks.map((w) => (<span class="h-3.5 w-3.5 rounded-[3px]" style={`background:${cell[w]}`}></span>))}
                <span class="ml-2 w-10 text-right font-mono text-[13px] text-ink">{m.now}</span>
              </span>
            </div>
          ))}
          <p class="mt-4 font-mono text-[10px] uppercase tracking-[0.14em] text-fern">Sample &middot; a scorecard your team runs weekly</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- 5 · PROOF -->
  <section class="border-b border-hairline px-6 py-16 md:py-20">
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-[1000px]">
      <p class="doc-label text-ink">What that looks like</p>
      <div class="mt-9 grid gap-6 md:grid-cols-2">
        <div class="rounded-[14px] border border-hairline bg-white/50 p-8">
          <p class="font-display text-xl leading-snug text-ink">
            "If you doubled your sales tomorrow, would you be happy, or freak out?"
          </p>
          <p class="mt-3 leading-relaxed text-fern">
            He was chasing more sales. He had a throughput problem, not a sales problem. We fixed how the work got delivered, and the growth followed.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="rounded-[14px] border border-hairline bg-white/50 p-8">
          <p class="font-display text-xl leading-snug text-ink">
            He didn't know where his revenue was even coming from.
          </p>
          <p class="mt-3 leading-relaxed text-fern">
            Focused on all the wrong things. We changed the sales process and doubled his growth, same headcount.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <a href="/testimonials" class="mt-8 inline-block font-mono text-[11px] font-medium uppercase tracking-[0.16em] text-moss transition-colors hover:text-ink">More results &rarr;</a>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- 6 · CLOSE -->
  <section class="px-6 py-16 md:py-24">
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-[680px] text-center">
      <h2 class="font-display text-3xl leading-tight text-ink md:text-[40px]">
        Let's talk.
      </h2>
      <p class="mx-auto mt-5 max-w-[46ch] text-lg leading-relaxed text-fern">
        First call's free. You'll get my honest read on the biggest thing I'd fix, whether we end up working together or not.
      </p>
      <a href={bookUrl} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="mt-8 inline-block rounded-full border border-ink bg-ink px-9 py-4 text-[15px] font-semibold text-parchment transition-opacity hover:opacity-90">
        Book a call
      </a>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
